{"version":1,"content":"<p>引進重點企業辦公室將於周四（22日）公布新一批重點企業名單及舉辦簽署儀式。</p><p>引進辦主任任景信今日（18日）在商台節目《政好星期天》中透露，此次預計引進10多至20間企業，海外企業與內地企業各佔一半，當中包括過千億市值的企業。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:18:49.024234+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:49:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T11:37:58.776006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:17:35.013642+00:00","content_hash":"8a7fcf76d87e1aee4704be8cf9ef42ca2baad8726acd292f1da77c59a564bd38","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}